WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.160
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: A picture shows planting,

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.475
watering, and a sprout. What happened second?

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:11.377
The answer is: watering. Order the events pictured.

00:00:12.283 --> 00:00:17.564
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which word starts an event

00:00:17.564 --> 00:00:17.894
recount?

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.519
The answer is: First. Sequence words help show event order.
